<p>The group went through the issues <a href=3D"https://github.com/ebu/ogra=
f/issues" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/ebu/o=
graf/issues</a></p>
<p>The group agreed to adopt the MIT licence; superfly will add the license=
 to the repository</p>
<p>StreamShapers demonstrated OGraf plugin in After Effects.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Black Magic integration of OGraf: issues still pending; work in progress=
</p>
<p>Roadmap will be discussed in the next meeting.</p>
